# Auto Commit & Push

Every time a code change is completed, immediately commit and push without waiting for the user to ask.

1. `git add` relevant files
2. `git commit` with a concise Conventional Commits message
3. `git push` to remote

Do NOT skip or defer — treat this as part of completing the task.
